# Keep these assets LF on every platform, including Windows checkouts with
# core.autocrlf=true and the windows-test CI job.
#
# - The license texts are embedded verbatim via go:embed and spliced into the
#   generated THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES artifact; CRLF here would leak into that output.
# - notices.golden is compared byte-for-byte by TestThirdPartyNoticesGolden, so
#   any line-ending drift would fail the test spuriously.
internal/ui/licenses/*.txt text eol=lf
internal/ui/testdata/*.golden text eol=lf
